Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 01:25:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ir, cam: ClearReceiveBuffer/ClearSendBuffer and SetPhotoMode

ir:USER ClearReceiveBuffer (0x0003) drops every packet in the receive
buffer; ClearSendBuffer (0x0004) has nothing to drop, because packets
are handed to the device as soon as they are sent. Kid Icarus: Uprising
calls both when it looks for the Circle Pad Pro.

cam:u/cam:c/cam:s SetPhotoMode (0x0021) is accepted without effect: the
photo mode only tunes a real camera's image processing. Angler's Club:
Ultimate Bass Fishing 3D (portrait mode on both outer cameras) and
Miitopia call it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
